Z||000000||DJRice||09-12-2001||11:07 PM||||Well I got a chance to meet some forum members yesterday evening at an Olive Garden in Orlando.  JSocha is in town for some training so Brian (Brian87egotrip) and his wife along with Dale and his wife from Central Florida Fieros and myself came out to eat, drink, and be merry.  We even got some smark remark from a Riced up Probe who happened to pull up while we were outside.  <P>These Pics are a bit dark, but I will post them anyway.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/orl1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/orl2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/orl3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/orl4.jpg"> <P>--Dillon||||reg||1
