Z||000003||JSocha||09-13-2001||12:14 PM||||Hey everybody!<P>I'm in Orlando, Florida at my training class!<P>Thanks DJ for posting the pics taken Tuesday night.  Sorry they turned out so dark.  Dang digital.  I just hope the 35mm turn out 1,000,000 times better.<P>It was a pleasure to personally meet DJRice, Brian87egotrip & his wife and NEPTUNE & his wife in person and as pictured above.<P>Pictured in the first picture (left to right) NEPTUNE's wife, NEPTUNE, Brian87egotrip and his wife and DJRice.<P>A few pictures down, JSocha to the left of NEPTUNE.<P>NEPTUNE!  Thanks for a great time lastnight.  Had a great time not to mention a good buzz going when you dropped me off at the hotel.<P>Have been following as many of the threads when I can and after I discovered we had internet access in our training room.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I just hope I get out of Florida safetly on Saturday and there are no more problems. YIKES  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  What a week.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
